WEBVTT

00:18:58.413 --> 00:19:01.496
I've finally been let in
to that to that secret.

00:19:02.163 --> 00:19:05.663
You also started working at 13.
You had a variety of jobs.

00:19:05.663 --> 00:19:08.829
You were a janitor's assistant at
your high school waxing floors.

00:19:09.079 --> 00:19:11.413
You were a waitress at the Dairy Queen.

00:19:12.038 --> 00:19:14.454
And I understand you can
put a on on the top of

00:19:14.454 --> 00:19:16.996
a soft serve ice cream cone like a pro.

00:19:17.288 --> 00:19:22.246
Of course, I worked there. So, yeah. I
mean, that's the thing growing up poor.

00:19:22.621 --> 00:19:26.454
What you quickly realize is
if you ever want anything,

00:19:26.704 --> 00:19:28.913
you have to earn the money yourself.

00:19:28.913 --> 00:19:33.454
Because even though my mom provided for
us to the best of her abilities,